From aee6e745685ddc8c61535f5883758fbf94365f38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quinn <coderquinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:54:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mac): keep unshown Omnibox popup contents hidden

---
